  "paper_id": "asplos-2024-fuyao-dpu-enabled-direct-data-transfer-for-serverless-co-9ab42628",
  "title": "FUYAO: DPU-enabled Direct Data Transfer for Serverless Computing",
  "abstract": "Serverless computing typically relies on the third-party forwarding method to transmit data between functions. This method couples control flow and data flow together, resulting in significantly slow data transmission speeds. This challenge makes it difficult for the serverless computing paradigm to meet the low-latency requirements of web services.",
